ATRcore S03 (contracts, boundaries and CSV logger)
  all       Build release main and C check entry
  debug     Build main_debug and char_debug with -O0 -g3
  run       Inspect boundary; ARGS='--help' lists CLI options
  char      Build build/char.exe
  check     Run C checks including CSV write/readback and I/O failures
  plot      Python postprocessing entry (pending model CSV stages)
  run-plot  Run, then plot, sequentially
  clean     Remove build only; keep results and reports
  help      Show this help
